      "cornerRadius": 16,
      "stroke": "$gray-200",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeAlignment": "inner",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DtB0A",
          "fill": "$gray-900",
          "content": "Spec: Fanshop order email",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "K1Pys",
          "fill": "$gray-800",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every product keeps its own prefilled email (like today’s “jetzt bestellen!” link), but the text is built from the user’s choices in the order sheet.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "OY7uq",
          "fill": "$gray-900",
          "content": "mailto composition",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "VvlXR",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "$gray-900",
          "cornerRadius": 12,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "padding": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "WSOBT",
              "fill": "$gray-200",
              "content": "to:      hvtdpstainz@gmx.at",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "s06zV4",
              "fill": "$gray-200",
              "content": "subject: Bestellung {item.name}",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "T5pJx",
              "fill": "$gray-200",
              "content": "body:    Hallo HV TDP Stainz,",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "xDpo0",
              "fill": "$gray-200",
              "content": "         ich möchte folgenden Artikel bestellen:",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "t4OL1h",
              "fill": "$gray-200",
              "content": " ",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "mfpQK",
              "fill": "$gray-200",
              "content": "         Artikel: {item.name}",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "KW783",
              "fill": "$gray-200",
              "content": "         {option.label}: {option.value}   // per option",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "X1xpm8",
              "fill": "$gray-200",
              "content": "         Anzahl: {quantity}",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "o5itb",
              "fill": "$gray-200",
              "content": "         Anmerkung: {note}               // if filled",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "GFtAE",
              "fill": "$gray-200",
              "content": " ",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "LubJd",
              "fill": "$gray-200",
              "content": "         Danke & sportliche Grüße!",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "NtihX",
          "fill": "$gray-900",
          "content": "Rules",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sgejC",
          "fill": "$gray-800",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Options come from product data (e.g. Größe, Variante, Farbe, Initialen, Betrag for Gutschein). Products without options show only Anzahl.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "fqhBx",
          "fill": "$gray-800",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• URL-encode subject and body (encodeURIComponent) — today’s link concatenates raw text, which breaks on “&”, “#” and line breaks.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "RGPev",
          "fill": "$gray-800",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• “E-Mail öffnen” = mailto link. “Text kopieren” copies subject + body to the clipboard and shows a toast “Text kopiert”.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WEcvI",
          "fill": "$gray-800",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• If no option is required, fall back to today’s text: “{item.description} Bitte um Angabe von Anzahl und Größe.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15
        }
      ]
    },
